From a06731a0679b7a791021d0e3f09c54497b1b9c59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: halt95 <halt95@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 08:41:02 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 47/58] worker: e2-identity and rank-tagged e2-toggles startup
 lines

Each worker logs its launch identity and, after warm-up and capture, one
e2-toggles line with the effective toggle state read back from the C++
extensions through two new tensor-free query ops. Both extensions must be
rebuilt.
---
